Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/arfelious/omen-fan-control

Package: omen-fan-control-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         omen-fan-control (= ${source:Upstream-Version}),
         dkms
Description: HP Omen/Victus fan control with DKMS auto-setup (metapackage)
 Metapackage that installs omen-fan-control together with the
 hp-wmi-omen DKMS kernel module.  The patched driver is placed in
 /usr/src/hp-wmi-omen-1.0 so DKMS builds it automatically on
 install and on every kernel upgrade.
 .
 For kernels >= 6.20 that include the driver upstream, install
 omen-fan-control alone instead.
